      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MCLEAN (9) has won three of his last four starts including last time out as the favourite over 1730m at Bathurst. Will need a bit of luck from a wide draw but in his current form rates well as a leading chance. JAXON BEACH (2) won well here two runs back, then finished third last start over 2300m at this track. Drawn well and looks well placed to return to winning form. CAPTAIN BART (6) finished an unlucky fourth last start over 1609m at this track after getting checked and then going into a break with 400m to run. Has won two of his last five starts and with better luck in the running today should be fighting out the finish. CARRAMAR OLAM (3) won here two runs backs, then last start finished eighth of 10 in a Listed event over 1609m at this track after racing outside the leader for most of the trip. He should find this field a lot easier and is worth a second look.",
